"food_rules": ["High-protein, whole-food, minimal processed","Staples: 5% beef mince, white rice, sweet potato, eggs, bananas, blueberries, red meat 2+/wk, skinless boneless chicken breast fillet, 5+ fruit/veg a day, peppers always cooked","Added 12 Nov (user request): porridge oats (dry weight, cooked in water, no dairy), pineapple, honeydew melon, energy gels for long runs","No dairy, no protein powder. Skyr/whey occasional only","Supplements: creatine, vitamin D, electrolytes. Pre-training: black coffee, ABE (lift days only), CarbX blackcurrant (pre-training only; gels replace CarbX during long runs)","All weights are cooked weights (meat, rice, veg, sweet potato baked) except oats, which are dry weight","No alcohol (USA fortnight is the one planned exception)","Weigh-ins: morning, before food, after toilet"],
