"long_run_scaling": {"reference":"Sat built for 9 mi (14.5 km), about 1 h 45.","kcal_per_extra_mile":125,"carbs_g_per_extra_mile":28,"how":"Add extra rice/sweet potato at Sat lunch and dinner, and extra gels in-run. Protein stays 170-190 g. Add the carbs at lunch and dinner (rice, sweet potato).","gel_note":"A gel is about 22 g carbs and 90 kcal. 2 an hour is about 44 g/h, 3 an hour 66 g/h, 4 an hour 88 g/h. Check your gel brand's carbs and adjust.","in_run_carbs_g_per_hour":{"wk3_9mi":"30-45 (about 2 gels/h)","half_marathon_and_wk6_on":"45-60","specific_block_wk28_on":"60, building to 90 by race day"},"note":"Every long run over about 90 minutes gets fuelled. Train the gut with the race gel."},
